     "\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<div dir=\"ltr\">\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n12 month job in Scotland</div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div></div>\r\n<div style=\"font-family:&quot;Tahoma&quot;,&quot;Geneva&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:12pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<hr style=\"display:inline-block;width:98%\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(0,0,0)\">\r\n<b>From:</b> National Centre for Statistical Ecology Members Mailing List &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt; on behalf of Phil Bouchet &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">0001b2103fc36a8...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Sent:</b> Wednesday, July 1, 2026 12:24<br>\r\n<b>To:</b> <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a> &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">NC...@JISCMAIL.AC.UK</a>&gt;<br>\r\n<b>Subject:</b> Senior Ecological Statistician position</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nDear list,</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nWe are recruiting for a 12-month temporary position available for a Senior Statistician (Level 6, 4 days per week).</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nThe role will focus on movement modelling and is fully funded from 01/09/26 - 31/08/27.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nThe closing date for applications is 13/07/26.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nFurther details and particulars are available here: <a href=\"https://bioss.current-vacancies.com/Jobs/Advert/4244101?cid=2065.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://bioss.current-vacancies.com/Jobs/Advert/4244101?cid%3D2065.&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492454464000&amp;usg=AOvVaw37aDILm_Hyhn_2kOIytopx\">\r\nhttps://bioss.current-vacancies.com/Jobs/Advert/4244101?cid=2065.</a></div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nPlease do circulate to any individuals who may be interested and to your wider networks.</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nThanks</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\nPhil</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\n<br>\r\n</div>\r\n<div style=\"direction:ltr;font-family:&quot;Aptos Display&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_EmbeddedFont&quot;,&quot;Aptos Display_MSFontService&quot;,&quot;Calibri Light&quot;,&quot;Helvetica Light&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(23,78,134)\">\r\n<a href=\"https://www.bioss.ac.uk/people/philbouchet\" title=\"https://www.bioss.ac.uk/people/philbouchet\" style=\"text-decoration:none\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.bioss.ac.uk/people/philbouchet&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792492454464000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2tkeVLrVuQ8KuaLLRhJ2t1\"><img style=\"width:317px;min-h